Personally I'd usually rather have Excalibur or Magicbane than any
other weapon.  Greyswandir does more damage and in some cases I'd
prefer it, but Excalibur's very good on the damage front (better in
the early game when under-enchanted) and searching is very valuable.
Magicbane's many other powers are also quite potent.  The Sceptre is
also pretty great (hungerless, slotless conflict is insanely powerful,
with MR to boot).

Essentially, if I have Excalibur I wouldn't sacrifest because the best
case is something that might or might not even be as good as the
weapon I already have.


